35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The mechanic says short runs kill the car. That explains the wear.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,My diary shows weekends are triple the load. We need a weekend rule.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fuel data is stark. Two of us carry the load, one carries none.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,I found out that asking favours every time is what breaks groups. We need a system.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen. That is a lot to split blindly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if we split fixed costs, we must fix the usage pattern.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, exactly. The weekend chaos is the real problem, not the fuel.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, a blind split ignores the reality of who actually drives.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, I agree. But we also need to stop the constant asking.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I see. So we need a way to track who drives how much.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,A trial of recording every run for a month seems fair.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,I support that. It will show us where the hours actually go.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,A month of recording will reveal the truth of our habits.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,I am in. It stops the favour-asking cycle.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I am in. It gives us the honest picture I need.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,Let us try the recording trial. It is the most neutral path.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,Agreed. Let's see the data before we commit to anything else.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us observe before we judge. The trial will guide us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"I hope it helps us talk better, too.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I am ready. Let's start the trial and see the real numbers.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
